  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>After the insertion of the slab and steady-state is reached, the energy stored in the capacitor is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>U</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>K</mi><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>After the removal of the lab and steady-state is reached, the energy stored in the capacitor is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>U</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>C</mi><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></msup><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p>",
